      "content": "10/30 17:00\n4.99$\n\nPD zad\nCG kero\n\n\nStory after Yena's ending\n\nThe main character has a personal problem.\nSo the main character is given security service from the company where Bang Ye-na works.\na whirlpool between work and love\nCan their love affair progress well?\n\n\nThe game features\n\n- Plenty of story to enjoy ( The storyline length is as long as Yena's storyline from the main game )\n- Add security elements to protect the main character.\n- New costume standing CG and new event CG\n- Vocal track performed by Yena ( voice actress Lee-Myungho )\n\n\nsteam link\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/1446770",
